      ],
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Rang Undang-Undang Kesatuan Sekerja (Pindaan) 2007"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan seksyen 31 dengan seksyen yang berikut: \"31. (1) Any registered trade union may, subject to section 34, change its name, provided that— (a) the votes pf at least one-half of its members entitled to vote are recorded; and (b) at least fifty per centum of the votes recorded are in favour of the change of name. (2) Notwithstanding subsection (1), a trade union may change its name without the consent of its members if there is a change in the name of the establishment being effected under any written law, occupation, ministry, department, or statutory authority, as the case may be, in respect of which the trade union is registered.\". Pindaan seksyen 32"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 32 Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan \"with or without dissolution or division of the funds of such trade unions or either or any of them\" dengan perkataan \"with all the funds of such trade unions vested in the amalgamated trade union and all their properties vested in the trustees of the amalgamated trade union\". Pindaan seksyen 37"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 37(2) Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"the Director General\" perkataan \"at fourteen days prior to such change\". Pindaan seksyen 38"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 38(2) Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan \"one\" dengan perkataan \"ten\". Seksyen baru 40A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_14",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "14",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 40 seksyen yang berikut: \"Imposition of levy 40A. A trade union may impose a levy on its members, provided that for each and every imposition of the levy— (a) the votes of at least one-half of the members who are entitled to vote are recorded; and (b) at least fifty per centum of the votes recorded are in favour of the imposition of such levy.\". Pindaan seksyen 49"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_15",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "15",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Perenggan 49(1 )(a) Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan \"to sell, exchange, charge or lease\" dengan perkataan \"lease, or with the consent of its members obtained by way of a resolution at a general meeting or a meeting of delegates sell, exchange or charge\". Seksyen baru 50A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_16",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "16",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 50 seksyen yang berikut: \"Collection of funds and moneys 50A. (1) NO trade union shall enter into any agreement with any person by which such person undertakes to raise funds or collect moneys for or on behalf of the trade union except with the prior approval in writing of the Director General and subject to such conditions as he may impose. (2) Subsection (1) shall not apply to any agreement where an employer make deductions from the wages of his workmen for payment to a trade union on account of subscriptions.\". Pindaan seksyen 56"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_17",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "17",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_17__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_17__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 56 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_17__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_17",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (1), dengan memotong perkataan \"by the secretary of the union\"; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_17__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_17",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan subseksyen (4) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: \"(4) Every registered trade union and president, secretary and treasurer of the registered trade union who fails to comply with any of the requirements of subsection (1) shall be jointly and severally guilty of an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding one hundred ringgit for each day or part of a day during which the default continues; and any secretary of a registered trade union who fails to comply with any of the requirements of subsections (2) and (3) shall be guilty of an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding one hundred ringgit for each day or part of a day during which the default continues.\". Pindaan seksyen 63"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_18",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "18",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 63(1) Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan \"one\" dengan perkataan \"five\". Seksyen barn 68A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_19",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "19",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 68 seksyen yang berikut: \"Service of summons issued by the Director General 68A. (1) A summons issued by the Director General under section 71 may be served personally, if practicable, on the person summoned by showing him the original summons and by tendering or delivering to him a copy of the summons. (2) Every person on whom a summons is so served shall, if so required by the serving officer, sign a receipt for the copy of the summons on the back of the original summons. 1 (3) In the case of a corporation the summons may be served on the secretary or other like officer of the corporation. (4) Where the person to be summoned cannot by the exercise of due diligence be found the summons may be served by leaving a copy of the summons for him with some adult member of his family or with his servant residing with him. (5) Where the person to be summoned cannot by the exercise of due diligence be found and service cannot be effected in the manner provided for in subsection (4), the serving officer shall affix a copy of the summons to some conspicuous part of the house or other place in which the person summoned ordinarily resides, and in such case the summons shall be deemed to have been duly served. (6) When a summons issued is served under this section, an affidavit of such service purported to be made before an officer duly authorized to administer an oath shall be admissible in evidence.\". Pengesahan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ini bolehlah dinamakan Akta Kesatuan Sekerja (Pindaan) 2007."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ini mula berkuat kuasa pada tarikh yang ditetapkan oleh Menteri melalui pemberitahuan dalam Warta, dan Menteri boleh menetapkan tarikh yang berlainan bagi permulaan kuat kuasa peruntukan yang berlainan Akta ini. Pindaan seksyen 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_2__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_2__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_2__para_d"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta Kesatuan Sekerja 1959 [Akta 262], yang disebut \"Akta ibu\" dalam Akta ini, dipinda dalam subseksyen 2(1)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_20",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "20",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Sesuatu kesatuan sekerja yang keanggotaannya terdiri daripada pekerja yang diambil kerja di tempat urusan atau pekerjaan seseorang majikan, termasuk mana-mana bahagian atau cawangan tempat urusan atau pekerjaan itu dan yang telah didaftarkan sebelum 5 Mei 1989, yang merupakan tarikh istilah \"establishment\" sebagaimana yang ditakrifkan dalam seksyen 2 Akta ibu mula berkuat kuasa, hendaklah bagi segala maksud disifatkan sebagai telah didaftarkan secara sah dan menurut undang-undang dan terus wujud seolah-olah kesatuan sekerja itu telah didaftarkan di bawah Akta ibu pada 5 Mei 1989."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas takrif \"Government\" takrif yang berikut: ' \"levy\" means any mandatory contribution, other than members' entrance fee or subscription, which is imposed by a trade union on its members;';"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam takrif \"Minister\", dengan menggantikan perkataan \"labour\" dengan perkataan \"human resources\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_2__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas takrif \"Peninsular Malaysia\" takrif yang berikut: ' \"person\" means an individual, corporation, statutory authority, society, trade union, co-operative society, firm and any other body, organization, association or group of persons, whether corporate or unincorporated; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_2__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam takrif \"trade union\" or \"union\", dalam subperenggan (c)(i), dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"good\" perkataan \"and harmonious\". Pindaan seksyen 3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_3__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_3__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 3 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_3__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menomborkan semula seksyen yang sedia ada sebagai subseksyen (1) seksyen itu;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_3__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (1) subseksyen yang berikut: \"(2) In the absence of the Director General of Trade Unions, the Deputy Director General shall have all powers and may discharge all duties and perform all functions conferred on the Director General of Trade Unions under this Act.\". Pindaan seksyen 4"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 4(1) Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"Deputy Director Generals, Directors\" perkataan \", Deputy Directors, Senior Assistant Directors\". Pindaan seksyen 10"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 10(2) Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"printed copy\" perkataan \"in the national language\". Pindaan seksyen 15"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_6__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_6__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_6__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 15(1) Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_6__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/msa@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memotong perkataan \"or\" di hujung perenggan (a);"
      }
    },
    {
